        <mxCell id="pnlCt" value="&lt;b&gt;ICS20Transfer&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;(Solidity, secp256k1 signed)&lt;/font&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;i&gt;approve(ICS20Transfer, MaxUint256)&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&lt;i&gt;sendTransfer({&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#160;&#160;&lt;i&gt;denom, amount, receiver,&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#160;&#160;&lt;i&gt;sourceClient, destPort, timeoutTimestamp&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&lt;i&gt;})&lt;/i&gt;&#10;- pulls the ERC-20 into escrow, never burns it&#10;- ICS26Router writes the packet commitment" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="24" y="1004" width="242" height="132" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
