        <mxCell id="pnlDt" value="&lt;b&gt;SP1ICS07Tendermint&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;(Solidity light client)&lt;/font&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;i&gt;ICS26Router.multicall([ ackPacket, ... ])&lt;/i&gt;&#10;- one fused Groth16 proof covers every packet&#10;- VERIFIER.verifyProof(...) then clears the commitments&#10;&#10;&lt;b&gt;The multicall cannot be split.&lt;/b&gt; The verified key-value pairs are cached only for the life of the transaction, so a second multicall over a subset reverts with KeyValuePairNotInCache." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
